// Sideload-only build settings, applied via `xcodebuild -xcconfig` in the
// fork's CI workflow. Enables the downloads code in the app-project targets
// (AppEntry's VideoDownloadService injection, the download widget) to match
// the ENABLE_DOWNLOADS define the SwiftPM package gets from Package.swift.
// Project-level only: SwiftPM dependency targets (Firebase, …) do not
// inherit this, unlike a command-line SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS
// override, which broke Firebase's GoogleUtilities module resolution.
SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) ENABLE_DOWNLOADS
